1100 0 obj
  << /ActualText (This poster explores how diarists use the language of heat \050to articulate their inner lives\056 Analyzing personal writings across different historical periods allows us to trace how the underlying emotions driving these heat expressions may shift over time\056)
     /K [ 4 ]
     /P 1101 0 R
     /Pg 1092 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

