1122 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Heat emerges as a flexible image in personal writing\054 serving \050as both an imaginative metaphor for passion and a physical description of discomfort\056 These findings suggest historical context might influence not only what emotions diarists describe\054 but how they articulate them on a physical and linguistic level\056 Despite methodological constraints and a compact dataset\054 heat remains an enduring tool for processing human experience\056)
